Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.94,0:25:09.94,Ameku-end-2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801.6,829.8)}向著閃     之中
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.94,0:25:09.94,Ameku-end-2.1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(827.2,829.8)}光
